===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something [[homologous]]; a homologous organ or part, chemical compound or a chromosome.
# {{context|linguistics|lang=en}} A word shared by two languages or dialects.
# {{context|genetics|lang=en}} One of a group of similar DNA sequences that share a common ancestry.
# {{context|organic chemistry|lang=en}} A member of a [[homologous series]]

